# CODEOWNERS (OWASP DevSecOps 2-2-1-4 Repository Hardening, 2-3-6-3 CI/CD
# Pipeline Security: changes to the pipeline and the supply chain get a
# deliberate review).
#
# With one maintainer this mostly documents which paths are sensitive: do not
# turn on "Require review from Code Owners" until a second maintainer can
# approve, or every PR will wait for a review nobody else can give. Add that
# person to the entries below when they join.

# Everything
*                               @yohoshimura

# The pipeline, and what it trusts
/.github/                       @yohoshimura
/.pre-commit-config.yaml        @yohoshimura
/src-tauri/deny.toml            @yohoshimura

# What gets compiled in
/package.json                   @yohoshimura
/package-lock.json              @yohoshimura
/src-tauri/Cargo.toml           @yohoshimura
/src-tauri/Cargo.lock           @yohoshimura

# What the webview may do, and how the app updates itself
/src-tauri/capabilities/        @yohoshimura
/src-tauri/tauri*.conf.json     @yohoshimura
/vite.config.js                 @yohoshimura

# The disclosure policy
/SECURITY.md                    @yohoshimura
